    {
      "id": "claim_9c030c340e274659923a60d97a727d3f",
      "statement": "AbstractController.handleRunPipeLineResult answers 200 OK both when a new run was started (message 'The result is being processed and can be queried using the id.') and when a cached result was returned ('The result is ready.'), while handleRunPipelineAndWaitForResult answers 200 OK with the result or 202 Accepted when the bounded wait times out; ArdocoResultResponse carries requestId, the HTTP status name, a message, a traceLinkType derived from the request ID via TraceLinkType.fromId, and the optional result payload.",
