    {
      "id": "claim_e98ac3895e3b4e35bf933b806ae58b2b",
      "statement": "Request IDs concatenate the TraceLinkType key prefix, ':', the project name, and a UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes hash over the concatenated bytes of the input files; additionalConfigs is deliberately not hashed, so requests differing only in configuration collide on the same ID and reuse the cached result (a documented limitation), and InconsistencyController overrides ID generation to use the 'swattrResultInconsistency:' prefix while reusing the SAD_SAM trace-link type.",
