      "statement": "The /api/configuration endpoint exposes ArDoCo's default configuration: ConfigurationProviderService reflects over concrete AbstractConfigurable subclasses under edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco and returns each @Configurable field's key and default value, a map clients can feed back as the additionalConfigs request parameter.",
